3. We store the fetched suggestions in the state.
4. We filter the suggested list to show only the suggestions that match the input value.
5. We render a list of suggestions as an unordered list.
6. When a user selects a suggestion, we update the input value and store the selected item.
7. We render the selected item as a paragraph below the input field.

